#: components/new-landing/sections/Testimonials.tsx
msgid "Finally an \"unsubscribe app\" that let's you *actually* unsubscribe and filter using Gmail filters (instead of always relying on the 3rd party app to filter those emails). Big plus for me, so I have all filters in one place (inside the Gmail filters, that is). Awesome work! Already a fan :)"
msgstr "终于有了一款真正能退订、并通过 Gmail 过滤器进行过滤的“退订应用”（而不是总依赖第三方应用来过滤这些邮件）。对我来说是个大加分项，这样所有过滤器都集中在一处（也就是 Gmail 过滤器里）。太棒了！我已经是粉丝了 :)"

